Parts of src/osx/apple_soc*.{hpp,cpp}, src/osx/smc.cpp and tests/apple_soc.cpp are ported
or adapted from the following projects (CLPC energy report table, DVFS tables and residency
math, SMC key reading; SMC system/DRAM power keys, PMP bandwidth histograms, ANE floor channels,
per-process GPU time from the AGXDeviceUserClient entries of the IORegistry):

  - macmon (https://github.com/vladkens/macmon), MIT License,
    Copyright (c) 2024 vladkens
  - mactop (https://github.com/metaspartan/mactop), MIT License,
